summary: Checks supported branches point to correct rawhide
description: |
  Fetch fedora-repos, obtain current rawhide release from it.
  Then test current active releases have the same rawhide release
  version on their stable branches too. Therefore their GPG keys
  should point to correct rawhide.
test: ./test.sh
framework: beakerlib
tier: 1
recommend+:
  - awk
  - git-core
  - curl
  - jq
